      "cooked": "<p>Hey,</p><p>Apologies if this is stated somewhere on another thread, but I paid for pre-orders for Oblivaeon and the storage box at GenCon 2016 (and went through the online registration for it), and haven't seen anything in the way of communication about the status. I sent an email through the website, but never got a reply. I have since moved as well, and would like to know 1 - When these products might be released and 2 - How I can update the address where it will be sent.</p><p>Thanks in advance!</p>",
