      "created_at": "2018-02-05T03:35:29.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>I can't help with part 2, but the most recent Kickstarter update (first Tuesday of January) had a very tentative prediction of things arriving at GtG in late April/early May, if memory serves me correctly. The shipping process will (per the State of GtG from GenCon) take a minimum of 6 weeks to complete. So, late Q2/early Q3 of this year.</p>",
